title: Intel GPU Engine Utilization
agents: linux
catalog: os/hardware
license: GPL
distribution: check_mk
description:
 Monitors the utilization percentage of Intel GPU hardware engines (Render/3D, Blitter, Video, VideoEnhance, Compute) via intel_gpu_top telemetry.

item:
 The name of the GPU engine, e.g. "Render/3D", "Video", "Compute".

examples:
 # Set custom warning (85%) and critical (95%) thresholds
 checkgroup_parameters:cmk_intel_gpu_engines = {
     "levels": (85.0, 95.0),
 }
